# WLISTTV.KEY - the headings and dividers of the list window, over the
# seed's three items: TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/WLISTTV.SNP, checked by
# TEST/headchk.py.  J, SHIFT-J and CTRL-J choose a column; I posts a
# press on its divider (SHIFT-I two pixels left, CTRL-I two right), M a
# click on its heading (SHIFT-M the press alone), K a move (SHIFT-K
# back, CTRL-K far left, CTRL-SHIFT-K far right), Q the release (SHIFT-Q
# WM_CANCELMODE); V shows the stored widths, Z the guide's pixels.
S START
K V
S STORE0
# The guide at the press on column 4's divider, then moved: the old
# place erased.  A Down key during the drag is dropped, Esc cancels and
# erases it, and the release after that changes nothing.
K SHIFT-J J J J J
S COL4
K I Z
S GUIDE0
K K Z
S GUIDE1
K DOWN ESC Z
S UNGUIDE
K Q
S ESCUP
# WM_CANCELMODE likewise.
K I K SHIFT-Q Z
S CANCEL
K Q
S CANCELUP
# Column 0 widened by 20 pixels, snapped to 17 characters: a WL_COLS
# note, no move, the bar across; released where it began, nothing.
K SHIFT-J I K Q
S WIDEN0
K V
S STORE1
K I Q
S SAME0
# Column 6 widened, rounded up to 21; column 4 held at WCOL_MINW and
# column 7 at WCOL_MAXW.
K SHIFT-J CTRL-J CTRL-J I K Q
S WIDEN6
K SHIFT-J J J J J I CTRL-K Q
S MIN4
K SHIFT-J CTRL-J I CTRL-SHIFT-K Q
S MAX7
K V
S STORE2
# Scrolled a cell: column 5's divider found where it is drawn.
K RIGHT
S RIGHT
K SHIFT-J J J J J J I K Q
S SCROLLED
# Clicks on a flat heading, on one naming an order the source lacks and
# on the order in use's button: nothing.
K LEFT SHIFT-J J M
S FLAT
K CTRL-J CTRL-J CTRL-J M
S NOORD
K SHIFT-J M
S SAMEORD
# TAB, then a click on ID's button: a move each, the arrow following,
# each table with its own widths.
K TAB
S SERIAL
K V
S SERSTORE
K SHIFT-J M
S CLICKID
K TAB
S SERIAL2
# ID's button held down, moved off it, back on, released: the switch.
K SHIFT-M
S PRESSED
K K K
S AWAY
K SHIFT-K SHIFT-K
S BACKON
K Q
S BACKUP
# Released off it, cancelled by Esc and by WM_CANCELMODE: no switch.
K TAB SHIFT-M K K Q
S NOSWITCH
K SHIFT-M ESC
S PESC
K Q
S PESCUP
K SHIFT-M SHIFT-Q Q
S PCANCEL
# The order in use's button held down, then released: nothing.
K J J J SHIFT-M
S PRESSCUR
K Q
S CURUP
# Dividers pressed within the grip: in Serial number's own heading, the
# grab kept, and in the next heading, which does not sort.
K SHIFT-I K Q
S SERWIDE
K SHIFT-J J J CTRL-I K Q
S SERWIDE2
K V
S STORE3
K TAB
S IDBACK
# Esc after the drags is the owner's again: the frame closes.
K ESC
S CLOSED
